### GET /api/health
GET {{BaseURL}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/categories
GET {{BaseURL}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/questions (science / Easy)
GET {{BaseURL}}/api/questions?category=science&difficulty=Easy
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/questions (invalid category)
GET {{BaseURL}}/api/questions?category=unknown
Accept: application/json

### GET unknown API route
GET {{BaseURL}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
